      "content": "Thanks for that breakdown. I'm curious about your reasoning on DeAndre and Chloe though. You mentioned DeAndre might lack leadership scope, but he's got 9 years in a high-stakes environment. On the flip side, you said Chloe is more about \"execution\" than leadership. \n\nWhen you're looking at \"culture fit\" and \"leadership presence\" for a senior role like this, what specific traits or markers are you picking up on in their profiles that differentiate the \"leaders\" from the \"executors\"? I want to make sure our hiring process is consistent.",
